  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Mauricio Pochettino signed a two-and-a-half-year deal to replace Michael Carrick, who had been dismissed on 12 November.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385829601:163"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "On 13 November 2026, Manchester United announced that Pochettino would join the club as head coach on 18 November, after his final two games for the U.S. men's team.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385829601:162"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Mauricio Roberto Pochettino Trossero, born 2 March 1972, is an Argentine professional football manager and former footballer who heads the United States national team.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385829601:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Mauricio Pochettino was born on 2 March 1972 in Santa Fe Province.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q313000:P569",
        "wd:Q313000:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "Between 1988 and 2004 he played for 9 clubs, beginning with Newell's Old Boys and including RCD Espanyol de Barcelona.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q313000:P54:Q221882",
        "wd:Q313000:P54:Q8780",
        "wd:Q313000:P54:Q172476"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:47Z",
      "text": "Readers also turned to the Michael Carrick article, which drew 67,479 readers on 12 November 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Michael_Carrick:2026-11-12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:56Z",
      "text": "On 12 November 2026, 168,183 people read the article, about 179 times the usual daily figure of 937.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Mauricio_Pochettino:2026-11-12",
        "views:en:Mauricio_Pochettino:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:01:03Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 11 languages, and after English the most readers were in Russian, with 7,685.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Mauricio_Pochettino:2026-11-12",
        "views:ru:Почеттино,_Маурисио:2026-11-12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:01:10Z",
      "text": "Each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers, though a language is not a country.",
      "cites": [
